  {
   "type": "text",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "India, officially the Republic of India, is a country in South Asia."
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "Early in the 2nd millennium, Muslim armies from Central Asia intermittently overran India's northern plains, eventually establishing the Delhi Sultanate and drawing India into the cosmopolitan networks of medieval Islam."
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "Etymology"
  },
  {
